<title>UK: LME deletes Argentine lead brand.</title>
<headline>LME deletes Argentine lead brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) is to delete the NOAR lead brand produced by Argentina's Martin Munster SA, an LME notice said.</p>
<p>No further deliveries will be accepted for LME warranting with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Once the stocks already on LME warrant by September 10 are exhausted, the brand will be delisted and will no longer be deliverable against the lead contract, the LME said.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
